/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/deployments","created_at":"2026-11-15T01:10:49Z","updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:38:50Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-24T14:33:09Z","git_url":"git://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:openwizdev/WizSite.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite","homepage":"","size":205874,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":61,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["agent-factory","cloudflare-pages","landing-page","open-source","static-site","website"],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":61,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/pulls/180","html_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite/pull/180","diff_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite/pull/180.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite/pull/180.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-24T12:04:33Z"},"body":"Implements openwizdev/OpenWiz#2964 (BK1 of spec #2963).\n\n## What was built\n\nPure modules (no network, no clock of their own, no new dependencies, Node.js 24 / Workers runtime only):\n\n- `lib/book/ical.js`: `busyFromIcal(text, fromMs, toMs)` returning merged, ascending `[{start, end}]` busy intervals overlapping `[fromMs, toMs)`.\n  - Unfolds lines (space and tab), handles `DTSTART`/`DTEND`/`DURATION`, UTC (`Z`), `TZID=` via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` (with DST), and floating times (`X-WR-TIMEZONE`, else UTC); ignores nested `VALARM` properties.\n  - Excludes all-day (`VALUE=DATE`), `TRANSP:TRANSPARENT`, and `STATUS:CANCELLED` events.\n  - Expands `RRULE` (`DAILY`, `WEEKLY`, `MONTHLY`, `YEARLY`, `INTERVAL`, `COUNT`, `UNTIL`, `BYDAY` including ordinals like `2TU`/`-1FR`, `BYMONTHDAY`, `BYMONTH`, `WKST`), applies `EXDATE` and `RECURRENCE-ID` overrides (moved or cancelled), and preserves local wall time across DST.\n  - Fails closed with `code: 'calendar_unreadable'` (never leaking event text) on non-calendars, unreadable events, unsupported rule parts (`BYSETPOS`, `BYWEEKNO`, `BYYEARDAY`, `FREQ` below `DAILY`, `RDATE`), and caps (5,000 events, 20,000 generated occurrences).\n- `lib/book/slots.js`:\n  - `settings(env)` parsing booking env defaults, falling back unknown `BOOK_MODE` to `off`, and throwing `code: 'bad_settings'` on malformed values.\n  - `window(cfg, nowMs)` returning `{fromMs, toMs}` covering notice, horizon, slot length, and buffers.\n  - `openSlots(cfg, busy, bookings, nowMs)` computing half-hour local slots wholly within working hours and days, enforcing notice, horizon, per-side buffers around busy intervals and bookings, local-day `maxPerDay` cap, and DST-safe 23/25-hour days.\n- `lib/book/fake.js`: `fakeBusy(cfg, fromMs, toMs)` generating a deterministic weekday meeting schedule for previews and tests.\n- `tests/book-core.test.mjs` and synthetic fixtures in `tests/book-fixtures/ical/`.\n\n## Proof\n\n1. Red first (commit `b0b0585`): `node --test tests/book-core.test.mjs` failed with `ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND` before implementation.\n2. Green (commit `d31a07b`):\n   - `node --test tests/book-core.test.mjs`: **22/22 passed** (0 failed, 131ms)\n   - `npm run build && npm run check && npm test`: **PASS** (106 public files built; links/resources/privacy check PASS; **54/54** Python tests OK)\n   - `npm run test:functions`: **132/132 passed** (0 failed)\n   - `python3 -I tools/comment-check/check.py diff --base origin/book`: `comment-check: ok`\n\nBuilt with [Cloudroom](https://cloudroom.dev)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/issues/180/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/issues/180/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]